@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = replace-with-a-valid-access-token
@roleId = 2
@resourceId = 1
@grantId = 1

### List active grants
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/concesiones-rol
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter grants by role
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/concesiones-rol?role_id={{roleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter grants by resource
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/concesiones-rol?resource_id={{resourceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Grant/reactivate a resource for a role
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/concesiones-rol
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role_id": {{roleId}},
  "resource_id": {{resourceId}}
}

### Inspect grant
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/concesiones-rol/{{grantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Deactivate grant
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/concesiones-rol/{{grantId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reactivate grant
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/concesiones-rol/{{grantId}}/reactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
